{"fingerprint":"f5d69582ff9c7b5e3b5c684300b55a3b1801df3a290576e0644b4a991ede79e1","startedAt":1794343815375,"progress":{"__components":{"wikidata:ids":{"attempts":1,"nextCheckAt":1794347415375,"status":"retry","httpStatus":null}},"tmdb:media":{"source":"tmdb-api","id":64905,"type":"tv","sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/64905","fetchedAt":"2026-11-10T20:53:05.158Z","originalLanguage":"en-US","title":{"value":"Stupidi al quadrato","language":"it-IT"},"originalTitle":"Science of Stupid","overview":{"value":"In STUPIDI AL QUADRATO, alcuni scienziati amatoriali offertisi volontari competono per il titolo di più disinformato mettendo alla prova principi scientifici quali la dinamometrica, la gravità e le Leggi di Newton. Come i nostri scienziati amatoriali hanno appreso a loro spese: se cerchi di infrangere le leggi della scienza, saranno esse a infrangere te. Questo è STUPIDI AL QUADRATO.","language":"it-IT"},"startDate":"2014-04-09","endDate":"2020-06-17","status":"Returning Series","rating":6.136,"ratingCount":22,"numberOfEpisodes":172,"numberOfSeasons":9,"genres":["Documentario","Reality","Commedia"],"countries":["United States of America","United Kingdom","Brazil","Germany","Mexico"],"facts":{"Runtime":"30m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[{"id":43,"name":"National Geographic","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q9rPBG1rHbUjII1Qn98VG2v7cFa.png"}],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":86470,"name":"Dallas Campbell","role":"Self - Host","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lBr4n544irZKPgm4Fg6x0Tg9kGB.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Stupidi al quadrato","overview":"In STUPIDI AL QUADRATO, alcuni scienziati amatoriali offertisi volontari competono per il titolo di più disinformato mettendo alla prova principi scientifici quali la dinamometrica, la gravità e le Leggi di Newton. Come i nostri scienziati amatoriali hanno appreso a loro spese: se cerchi di infrangere le leggi della scienza, saranno esse a infrangere te. Questo è STUPIDI AL QUADRATO."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"This show combines cold hard science with some of the craziest, most spectacular and painful user generated clips ever recorded. Richard Hammond introduces all manner of mishaps featuring brave, if misguided individuals from around the world and then explains the science behind their failure and humiliation with the use of bespoke animations and super slo-mo cinematography. Every episode features between 50 and 60 clips of misadventure – ordinary folk making extraordinary mistakes. Each week watch stunts involving weightlifting, shooting guns or jumping over cars, that have gone wrong, paused, re-wound, and re-played and analysed to determine exactly what went wrong and why. Richard explains the physics, chemistry and biology at play, then presents forensic details to explain the stupidity that resulted in failure. He’ll look at everything including weight, volume, momentum, combustion and even how the brain operates. This is misadventure explained. This is the Science of Stupid."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kHOceZ8eYRQ0P6SEdxH3AxJOd0y.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oVxQNJUi0NY4mj6VYgFWlgP5aL1.jpg","seasons":[{"seasonNumber":0,"name":{"value":"Speciali","language":"it-IT"},"year":2018,"episodeCount":20,"posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/64905/season/0"},{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2014,"episodeCount":14,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6gFZklISFaGkVZrEhhblP0DOxY1.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/64905/season/1"},{"seasonNumber":2,"name":{"value":"Stagione 2","language":"it-IT"},"year":2015,"episodeCount":34,"posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/64905/season/2"},{"seasonNumber":3,"name":{"value":"S